TIP:  You'll play the (F) and then the (Fsus) so keep the (F) formation and just tuck your pinky under the ring finger on the 3rd string/3rd fret and then release to get back to the (F).  For the (Em) - (Esus) sort of the same thing.  Hold the (Em) form and add your pinky to the 3rd string/2nd fret.
   

